{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0174_1000_002chi", "source_sha256": "4cfce5c213ef00ee708c7c84acbef3bb6b8d77bd95030f970bf036746e1385e0", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ様です。\nこの衣装、本当に素敵ですね。ありがとうございます。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n这套服装真的很漂亮。谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0174_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e81c2b2ea22d1c9fc4b6a336bf114e84918d9292e16c360dabbefe2699eeee02", "ja": "うん、思った通り、よく似合ってるな！\n千早にはこういう衣装も似合うと思ったんだ。", "zh": "嗯，果然和我预想的一样，很适合你啊！\n我就觉得这种服装千早穿起来也会很合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0174_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "252791ebc0ee1860c6849df13be16d80d68acb71c8cadbd41c164901f453724f", "ja": "そ、そうですか……。\nでは、勉強の成果が出たのかもしれません。", "zh": "是、是吗……。  \n那么，或许是学习有了成果吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0174_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2f75dabecb334c821e011d6f39ad4c012fbcf2987bfff768a7f0281c911ff026", "ja": "勉強？　何か勉強したのか？", "zh": "学习？你学了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0174_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "e08eb4ab357e10760dbd6c683769d529282a828cefccff11599aee0eaea5aac8", "ja": "はい。仕事の参考になればと、\n桜について少しだけ。", "zh": "是的。我想说不定能对工作有所帮助，所以稍微了解了一下樱花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0174_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "3b75cd74d5a1328fdd99ab968158529d8f1ebb6195877067b5ed2b83476d9b50", "ja": "昔から、ひろく愛されていたんですね。\n和歌にも、桜を題材にしたものがたくさんあって。", "zh": "从很久以前开始，樱花就一直深受人们喜爱呢。和歌中也有许多以樱花为题材的作品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0174_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "f00e6bdcca2823e7a5ec98af6587fb18255c04ae33b2b4d6233689973e4e0f0e", "ja": "最近の曲でも、桜を様々になぞらえていて……。\nあらためて、見る人によって違うのだなと思いました。", "zh": "就连近来的歌曲，也以各种方式借咏桜花……\n重新想来，同样的事物在不同人眼中果然各有不同。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0174_1007_p", "source_sha256": "803676c4b800dc5580178426ed2531bb2875829c924e02d22fc7793d25be4921", "ja": "見る人それぞれの感じ方か……。たしかに、\n同じ桜からでも、いろんなイメージが膨らむからな。", "zh": "每个人看法都不同吗……确实，\n即使面对同样的樱花，也能联想到各种各样的意象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0174_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "6516ea3ef39d372cf85edbc1f6fa0126b115db4f87eaaae30e69cad456ccf965", "ja": "はい。……きっと、この衣装についても、\n同じことがいえるかと。", "zh": "是的……我想，这套服装应该也是一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0174_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "9612638be554e55c0947e6b464bc43aae5290d5ea7e11210402440e1fb8d52a9", "ja": "この桜の花に身を包んで、いろいろな想いを表現\nできるように……これからも精進していきます。", "zh": "身着樱花装束，为了能够表达各种各样的情感……今后我也会继续精进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0174_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "12b98b0b43aa3ae9ea090ef7c63e3b3c7e7009bf526736f542f6a463beac73e1", "ja": "？　あの……{$P$}、どうしました？\nそんなに……マジマジと、見つめて。", "zh": "？那个……{$P$}，怎么了？一直……这么目不转睛地盯着我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0174_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0ed24e786c521f2e80ec6c5a1908591ef62de056b307369d1ae5dcb3a6a2c0fe", "ja": "いや、いろいろと考えて、様々な表現のために\n精進してくれるのも嬉しいんだけど……", "zh": "没有，你能去思考各种各样的事情，为了展现出\n丰富多样的表现力而精益求精，我也很高兴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0174_1013_p", "source_sha256": "21cbfbc6ff215b77ceeb10d0ec685a86b308501486a1eed0500bf6d1b02fcf3e", "ja": "何はともあれ、かわいさは\nバッチリ表現できてて良かったな！と思って。", "zh": "不管怎么说，能把可爱完美地表现出来，真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0174_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "420505f1d02ef16dae32f5c34abe8b07db51b2367f93bc4c908fe9756d3d51fe", "ja": "っ……。", "zh": "唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0174_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "396f44ee01a88c570c97b8ebc3e18fa62ad61e356589e95acf0b4e2d0f798cb5", "ja": "そ、そうですか。あの……それは、よかったです。\nそういうのも……これからも、精進します。", "zh": "这、这样啊。那个……那就好。\n这种方面……今后我也会继续努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
